---
---

<section id="cs-process" class="cs-process" aria-label="How we build">
	<div class="cs-process-intro">
		<p class="cs-eyebrow cs-rise">How we build</p>
		<h2 id="cs-process-title" class="cs-rise cs-rise-d1">You see it take shape. Nothing is a surprise.</h2>
		<p class="cs-process-intro-text cs-rise cs-rise-d2">Four steps, each one ending with something you can look at and react to. You stay in the loop from the first conversation to launch day.</p>
	</div>
	<ol class="cs-steps">
		<li class="cs-step cs-rise" style="--i:0">
			<div class="cs-step-panel">
				<div class="cs-step-head">
					<span class="cs-step-num">01 / 04</span>
					<span class="cs-step-label">LISTEN</span>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-step-body">
					<div class="cs-step-text">
						<h3>Listen and map</h3>
						<p>We sit down with you and your team, walk through how the work really happens today, and find where time and money leak. No jargon, no rush.</p>
							<p class="cs-step-you-get">You get: <span>A clear written brief you can check and correct.</span></p>
					</div>
					<svg class="cs-diagram" data-s="1" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 520 300" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
							<g>
								<rect x="28" y="52" width="132" height="72" rx="12" class="cs-d-note" />
								<rect x="44" y="70" width="72" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" />
								<rect x="44" y="86" width="96" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" opacity=".7" />
								<rect x="44" y="102" width="56" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" opacity=".5" />
								<rect x="72" y="108" width="132" height="72" rx="12" class="cs-d-note" />
								<rect x="88" y="126" width="80" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" />
								<rect x="88" y="142" width="92" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" opacity=".7" />
								<rect x="88" y="158" width="60" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" opacity=".5" />
								<rect x="18" y="164" width="132" height="72" rx="12" class="cs-d-note" />
								<rect x="34" y="182" width="68" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" />
								<rect x="34" y="198" width="88" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" opacity=".7" />
								<rect x="34" y="214" width="52" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line" opacity=".5" />
							</g>
							<path d="M224 150h52" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
							<path d="M268 142l10 8-10 8" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
							<g>
								<rect x="300" y="56" width="192" height="52" rx="12" class="cs-d-list" />
								<circle cx="326" cy="82" r="14" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
								<text x="326" y="86" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-text)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" font-family="var(--font-mono)">1</text>
								<rect x="352" y="72" width="112" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
								<rect x="352" y="86" width="76" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
								<rect x="300" y="124" width="192" height="52" rx="12" class="cs-d-list" />
								<circle cx="326" cy="150" r="14" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
								<text x="326" y="154" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-text)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" font-family="var(--font-mono)">2</text>
								<rect x="352" y="140" width="104" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
								<rect x="352" y="154" width="84" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
								<rect x="300" y="192" width="192" height="52" rx="12" class="cs-d-list" />
								<circle cx="326" cy="218" r="14" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
								<text x="326" y="222" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-text)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" font-family="var(--font-mono)">3</text>
								<rect x="352" y="208" width="96" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
								<rect x="352" y="222" width="68" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							</g>
						</svg>
				</div>
			</div>
		</li>
		<li class="cs-step cs-rise" style="--i:1">
			<div class="cs-step-panel">
				<div class="cs-step-head">
					<span class="cs-step-num">02 / 04</span>
					<span class="cs-step-label">DESIGN</span>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-step-body">
					<div class="cs-step-text">
						<h3>Design and agree</h3>
						<p>Before we build, you see the screens. We adjust until it matches how your people will actually use it, then we agree on what version one includes.</p>
							<p class="cs-step-you-get">You get: <span>Screens and a scope you have approved.</span></p>
					</div>
					<svg class="cs-diagram" data-s="2" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 520 300" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
							<rect x="34" y="36" width="300" height="196" rx="14" class="cs-d-wire" />
							<rect x="34" y="36" width="300" height="40" rx="14" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<path d="M34 76h300" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<circle cx="58" cy="56" r="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<circle cx="76" cy="56" r="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<circle cx="94" cy="56" r="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="58" y="98" width="120" height="10" rx="5" class="cs-d-wire-line" />
							<rect x="58" y="120" width="160" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-wire-line" opacity=".7" />
							<rect x="58" y="136" width="140" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-wire-line" opacity=".7" />
							<rect x="58" y="160" width="96" height="44" rx="8" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="166" y="160" width="144" height="44" rx="8" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="356" y="56" width="130" height="220" rx="22" class="cs-d-wire" />
							<rect x="370" y="86" width="102" height="164" rx="10" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="404" y="68" width="34" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="384" y="104" width="74" height="10" rx="5" class="cs-d-wire-line" />
							<rect x="384" y="126" width="74" height="38" rx="8" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="384" y="176" width="58" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-wire-line" opacity=".7" />
							<rect x="384" y="192" width="66" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-wire-line" opacity=".7" />
							<circle cx="304" cy="212" r="22" class="cs-d-check-bg" />
							<path d="M294 212l7 7 14-15" class="cs-d-check" />
						</svg>
				</div>
			</div>
		</li>
		<li class="cs-step cs-rise" style="--i:2">
			<div class="cs-step-panel">
				<div class="cs-step-head">
					<span class="cs-step-num">03 / 04</span>
					<span class="cs-step-label">BUILD</span>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-step-body">
					<div class="cs-step-text">
						<h3>Build and show</h3>
						<p>We build in short stretches and show you working software along the way, so you can react early instead of at the end.</p>
							<p class="cs-step-you-get">You get: <span>Regular demos of the real thing.</span></p>
					</div>
					<svg class="cs-diagram" data-s="3" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 520 300" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
							<rect x="34" y="34" width="452" height="232" rx="16" class="cs-d-screen" />
							<rect x="34" y="34" width="452" height="44" rx="16" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<path d="M34 78h452" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<circle cx="60" cy="56" r="5" fill="var(--kt-clay-light)" />
							<circle cx="78" cy="56" r="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<circle cx="96" cy="56" r="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="60" y="100" width="180" height="86" rx="12" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="78" y="150" width="20" height="22" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<rect x="106" y="136" width="20" height="36" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="134" y="144" width="20" height="28" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<rect x="162" y="128" width="20" height="44" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="190" y="140" width="20" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--kt-clay-light)" opacity=".8" />
							<rect x="264" y="100" width="196" height="86" rx="12" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="282" y="120" width="120" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line2" />
							<rect x="282" y="138" width="160" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line2" opacity=".7" />
							<rect x="282" y="156" width="140" height="8" rx="4" class="cs-d-line2" opacity=".7" />
							<rect x="60" y="206" width="400" height="10" rx="5" class="cs-d-progress" />
							<rect x="60" y="206" width="280" height="10" rx="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<g>
								<circle cx="120" cy="244" r="13" class="cs-d-check-bg" />
								<path d="M114 244l4 4 9-10" class="cs-d-check" />
								<circle cx="260" cy="244" r="13" class="cs-d-check-bg" />
								<path d="M254 244l4 4 9-10" class="cs-d-check" />
								<circle cx="400" cy="244" r="13" class="cs-d-check-bg" />
								<path d="M394 244l4 4 9-10" class="cs-d-check" />
							</g>
						</svg>
				</div>
			</div>
		</li>
		<li class="cs-step cs-rise" style="--i:3">
			<div class="cs-step-panel">
				<div class="cs-step-head">
					<span class="cs-step-num">04 / 04</span>
					<span class="cs-step-label">LAUNCH</span>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-step-body">
					<div class="cs-step-text">
						<h3>Launch and look after it</h3>
						<p>We put it live, train your team, and stay close while everyone gets used to it. After launch we fix, improve and support it.</p>
							<p class="cs-step-you-get">You get: <span>A live system, a trained team and someone to call.</span></p>
					</div>
					<svg class="cs-diagram" data-s="4" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 520 300" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
							<rect x="34" y="30" width="300" height="176" rx="14" class="cs-d-screen-f" />
							<rect x="34" y="30" width="300" height="40" rx="14" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<path d="M34 70h300" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="248" y="42" width="64" height="24" rx="12" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<text x="280" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="cs-d-chip-text">LIVE</text>
							<rect x="56" y="90" width="116" height="10" rx="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="56" y="112" width="156" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="56" y="128" width="136" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="56" y="152" width="96" height="34" rx="8" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<rect x="164" y="152" width="148" height="34" rx="8" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="356" y="46" width="130" height="196" rx="22" class="cs-d-screen-f" />
							<rect x="370" y="74" width="102" height="144" rx="10" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<rect x="404" y="58" width="34" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="384" y="92" width="74" height="10" rx="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="384" y="114" width="74" height="34" rx="8" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
							<rect x="384" y="158" width="58" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<rect x="384" y="174" width="66" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" />
							<g>
								<circle cx="120" cy="242" r="14" class="cs-d-check-bg" />
								<path d="M113 242l5 5 10-11" class="cs-d-check" />
								<text x="120" y="272" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="500" font-family="var(--font-mono)" letter-spacing="0.06em">TRAINING</text>
								<circle cx="260" cy="242" r="14" class="cs-d-check-bg" />
								<path d="M253 242l5 5 10-11" class="cs-d-check" />
								<text x="260" y="272" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="500" font-family="var(--font-mono)" letter-spacing="0.06em">HANDOVER</text>
								<circle cx="400" cy="242" r="14" class="cs-d-check-bg" />
								<path d="M393 242l5 5 10-11" class="cs-d-check" />
								<text x="400" y="272" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="500" font-family="var(--font-mono)" letter-spacing="0.06em">SUPPORT</text>
